/// known-gap: interp has no `each tick:` on overlays
/// An `each tick:` change that takes a whole-number field past the largest
/// whole number is an error (R1221), not a wrapped or crashed value.
<>C |
    ~n: 0
xx
overlay Up |
    lasts 3 ticks
    each tick:
        n + 1
    end
end
c <> C | n: :int("9223372036854775807")
overlay Up on c at 1
attempt
    tick()
rescue e
    say(:has("{e}", "R1221"))
xx
